CAT
===

Display file contents.


BASIC
-----
cat file.txt

Shows entire file in terminal.


OPTIONS
-------
Multiple files:
  cat file1.txt file2.txt

Show line numbers:
  cat -n file.txt

Create file:
  cat > newfile.txt
  (type content, press Ctrl+D)


COMBINE FILES
-------------
cat file1.txt file2.txt > combined.txt

Merges files into one.


WHEN TO USE
-----------
• Quick view of small files
• Combine files
• Create simple files


FOR LARGE FILES
---------------
Use less or more instead:
  less bigfile.txt
  (press q to exit)
